{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/daaf35bab3982e4f23fe6f87d7ec2624.avif?t=1763129750\" width=609 height=174 /></span><br><br><strong>Survive the Addicted in a top-down shooter that blends chaos and strategy!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An energy drink gone wrong changed the world. Choose your hero, face ever-tougher waves, and upgrade your arsenal, solo or with friends, to clear as many waves as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What awaits you?</strong><br><br><strong>Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get your hands on a wide range of weapons, pick your favorites, and start mowing down hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/37392d9896bf829b1f6b64d95648cbe1.poster.avif?t=1763129750\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/37392d9896bf829b1f6b64d95648cbe1.webm?t=1763129750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/37392d9896bf829b1f6b64d95648cbe1.mp4?t=1763129750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Salvation For All</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Salvation For All to get weapons you won\u2019t find on the map. These special weapons deal higher damage and, if you\u2019re lucky, you might get the God Weapon, one of the most powerful weapons in the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/4ec12e5fe0bca9950d5c23b2436cc2e6.poster.avif?t=1763129750\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/4ec12e5fe0bca9950d5c23b2436cc2e6.webm?t=1763129750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/4ec12e5fe0bca9950d5c23b2436cc2e6.mp4?t=1763129750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atonic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atonic, the machine that created the infamous energy drink, has been reworked to imbue weapons with special powers. Try it out and feel the full power of your arsenal in your hands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/51a607e5f6e6ef7ab71df931b545ea85.poster.avif?t=1763129750\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/51a607e5f6e6ef7ab71df931b545ea85.webm?t=1763129750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/51a607e5f6e6ef7ab71df931b545ea85.mp4?t=1763129750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vending Machine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy energy drink variants from vending machines to boost your stats and stay alive longer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/19b469f33bb5e6dac9b793d91d4f8aec.poster.avif?t=1763129750\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/19b469f33bb5e6dac9b793d91d4f8aec.webm?t=1763129750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/19b469f33bb5e6dac9b793d91d4f8aec.mp4?t=1763129750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Power Up</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to quickly pick up the power-ups dropped by the Addicted: they\u2019re temporary boosts and they won\u2019t last forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/647ed17f5d4964298076d69c20f9de81.poster.avif?t=1763129750\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/647ed17f5d4964298076d69c20f9de81.webm?t=1763129750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/extras/647ed17f5d4964298076d69c20f9de81.mp4?t=1763129750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>ARE YOU READY? PLAY THE DEMO!</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3423230?t=1763129750","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3423230?t=1763129750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/8f3b039b02140e4e648ad5cd8d15545a6d617b50/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763129750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3423230/8f3b039b02140e4e648ad5cd8d15545a6d617b50/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763129750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4104940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img 